 Desktop and XR point at the same native Control tree and exact-subject scene
 picker. The display texture owns no focus; native buttons/editors retain it.
+The spatial panel preserves the shared GUI texture's aspect at its existing
+height; ray bounds use that same quad. Resizing cancels captures before rearming.
+The black scene supplies neutral ambient illumination for authored shaded models.
 Focus/visibility loss, stale tracking, context changes and source withdrawal
 cancel captures without activation and require neutral before rearming.
